Package: hifiberry-aes67
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, systemd, pipewire (>= 1.1)
Description: HiFiBerry AES67 receiver
 Receives AES67 audio from a Dante network and plays it through the HiFiBerry
 DAC using PipeWire. Streams announced over SAP are discovered automatically and
 exposed over a REST API for selection from the web interface.
 .
 This is a listening endpoint rather than a clock-synchronised AES67 device: it
 does not run a PTP daemon, so it does not share the Dante clock.
